    <briefdescription>
<para>Finite-differences engine for dividend options using shifted dividends. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This engine uses the same algorithm that was used in versions 0.3.11 and earlier. It produces results that are different from the Merton-73 engine.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000057"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Review literature to see whether this is described</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
